          "name:8": "The First Night",
          "desc:8": "Welcome to Many Dimensions!\n\nDon\u0027t get used to things being nice and comfy. In about ten minutes, the sun will set, and unlike Vanilla, there\u0027s no light at night but plenty of mobs coming to get you. So, your first task is to find food and shelter for the night.\n\nSome links may help you in the journey:\n\n{Embed}TypeLink;https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1feI13R74h3O5BQZ_BH1YhuBlVqM4EBJDJm8WS7RCucs/edit?usp\u003dsharing;132;16;Many Worlds Spreadsheet{Embed}"
