          "desc:8": "In this world, trees won’t fall so easily. Without the right tools, logs will remain out of reach, blocking your path to progress.\n\nTo properly collect Tree Logs, you’ll need a Flint Axe—your first real tool for woodworking. Swinging your fists at a tree won’t help, and trying will only waste time. Gather Flint, craft your axe, and only then will you be able to chop down trees and unlock the many resources they provide.\n\nWood is the backbone of survival—get the right tools and take it for yourself."
